  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Logic: First no. = [(Second no. ÷ 2)²]**\n\n**64 : 16 →**\n\n​⇒ [(16 ÷ 2)²]\n\n​⇒ (8)² = 64​\n\n**256 : 32 →**\n\n​⇒ [(32 ÷ 2)2]\n\n​⇒ (16)2 = 256\n\nSimilarly, for '169 : ?' →\n\n​⇒ [(x ÷ 2)2] = 169\n\n​⇒ (x ÷ 2) = 13\n\n​⇒ x = (13 × 2)\n\n​⇒ **x = 26**​\n\nHere, **'169 : 26'** is the correct pair.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option (4)\".\n\n70:Tb02,\n<p sty",
